   "id": "sec1-1",
   "section": "Background",
   "text": "On March 24, 2020, Governor Brad Little signed into law S1385, a trigger law stating that if and when states are again allowed to ban abortion on their own authority, performing an abortion would be a felony in Idaho except for cases of the life of the mother, rape, or incest; exceptions are not made for the health of the pregnant person nor of the fetus.",
